What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/macsmc-reboot/<dev>/ac_power_mode
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.4
Description:
		What the machine does when external power arrives, as kept in
		the PMU (present only when the device tree gives the reboot
		node a pm_setting cell). Reading lists the modes with the
		current one in brackets; writing a mode name sets it:

		off:
			stay off
		restore:
			power on after a power loss if the machine was on
		always:
			power on whenever power is connected (the 2024 and later
			desktops; other machines may ignore it)
